title: "AtpMcp"
abstract: >-
  AtpMcp is a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes the SystemOnTPTP,
  StarExec, Isabelle and LocalExec theorem-prover backends of AtpClient as tools
  for language-model agents over stdio JSON-RPC.
